<view class="page"
  ><view wx:if="{{mode === 'MOCK'}}" class="banner-note"
    >本地演示 · 预约仅保存在本机，不会发送给商家</view
  ><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"
    >{{error}}<button class="link" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view
  ><view class="eyebrow">WE ARE LISTENING</view
  ><view class="title">每一条建议，都有意义</view
  ><view class="muted">此页面为反馈表单，不提供实时消息或订阅通知。</view>
  <form class="section card" bindsubmit="submit">
    <textarea
      class="input textarea"
      name="message"
      value="{{message}}"
      maxlength="1000"
      placeholder="请描述您的建议或遇到的问题（请勿填写敏感资料）"
    /><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"
      ><label class="privacy"
        ><checkbox
          value="yes"
          color="{{config.primaryColor}}"
        />同意为处理反馈保存所填内容</label
      ></checkbox-group
    ><button class="link" bindtap="privacy">阅读隐私说明</button
    ><button
      class="primary"
      form-type="submit"
      loading="{{loading}}"
      disabled="{{loading}}"
    >
      提交反馈
    </button>
  </form>
  <view wx:if="{{mode === 'CLOUDBASE'}}" class="card"
    ><view class="heading">文件上传测试</view
    ><view class="muted"
      >独立验证云存储能力，文件暂不关联反馈。仅选择非敏感测试图片。</view
    ><button class="secondary" bindtap="upload">选择并上传图片</button
    ><view wx:if="{{uploaded}}" class="success">上传完成</view></view
  ></view
>
